  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Empower Spell",
    "definition_type_raw": "Metamagic",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook",
    "definition_raw": "You can increase the power of your spells, causing them to deal more damage.\n\nBenefit: All variable, numeric effects of an empowered spell are increased by half including bonuses to those dice rolls.\n\nSaving throws and opposed rolls are not affected, nor are spells without random variables.\n\nLevel Increase: +2 (an empowered spell uses up a spell slot two levels higher than the spell’s actual level.)",
